              %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Kan+extension#AlongFibrations"} here
              at
              = succeed ")" do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+extension"} Kan extension
            %p By definition, that fiber is
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
