                    %mo ,
                    %mi 𝒞
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [S, \mathcal{C}]
              be a Reedy fibration which is a weak equivalence over all objects of degree
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
