                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Match_n(f) :  Match_n(X) \to  Match_n(Y)
              is over each
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
